Source-landscape note: The 2023 Thailand information environment is substantial and multilingual. It includes election-observation reports, official/legal materials, international organizations, rights and media-freedom monitors, academic analysis, investigative NGOs, and reputable Thai and international reporting. The main source families concern electoral competitiveness, military-appointed Senate influence, constitutional and judicial checks, opposition and protest rights, media and digital freedom, institutional neutrality, and the transfer from Prayut’s government after the May 2023 election. All candidates below remain unopened discovery leads; no evidence claims or scores are assigned.

